1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,750
Three teammates. One right pass.

2
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:04,050
He beats his man.

3
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:05,170
Here comes the help.

4
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:06,150
Freeze.

5
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:08,150
A, B, or C?

6
00:00:08,520 --> 00:00:09,430
Two seconds.

7
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:13,150
A is the easy pass.

8
00:00:13,280 --> 00:00:14,790
But his defender stayed home.

9
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:17,870
B? His defender is sitting in the passing lane.

10
00:00:18,059 --> 00:00:19,610
Now watch the low defender.

11
00:00:19,680 --> 00:00:21,850
He left the corner to stop the drive.

12
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:24,130
That's the read. C.

13
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:25,150
Kick it.

14
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:28,170
The next rotation is a step too late.

15
00:00:28,420 --> 00:00:29,770
Stop watching the ball.

16
00:00:29,860 --> 00:00:30,830
Watch the help.

17
00:00:30,980 --> 00:00:32,290
Got it in two seconds?

18
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:33,390
Run it back.

